{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! We have accepted your bid to redevelop Block #27343 inside Novo Stappelstad! This site is truly a blank slate. The former occupant, Yamaha Piano Research Division, was wiped out when an rogue wormhole escaped containment. Not a single building was left behind. You will have eight weeks to complete your contract. Make sure you hit your weekly milestones, or else you and your company will be terminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 different buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 unique islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 research to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 objectives to complete the demo</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211880?t=1740409338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211880/c6d425fc4a88914d43b78867a4ea418fe61e9b06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740409338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211880/4508f6cc1ae77b9479a18630fe3e57d88d1682c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740409338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211880/4508f6cc1ae77b9479a18630fe3e57d88d1682c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740409338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! We have accepted your bid to redevelop Block #27343 inside Novo Stappelstad! This site is truly a blank slate. The former occupant, Yamaha Piano Research Division, was wiped out when an rogue wormhole escaped containment. Not a single building was left behind. You will have eight wee